            <p>
                I am the author of <a href="/books/a-year-of-mornings/">A Year of Mornings</a>, a collection of poems for young adults.
                I work as an assistant consultant with TCS.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Mobile: Just the heading and content -->
      <div class="sm:hidden">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-center">Hi! I'm Sajal.</h1>
        <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none mb-6">
          <p>
              I am the author of <a href="/books/a-year-of-mornings/">A Year of Mornings</a>, a collection of poems for young adults. I am also...
